---
// A real part/whole example, not a mascot or an interactive-looking mockup.
---
<figure class="math-preview" aria-labelledby="preview-caption">
  <div class="math-preview__parts" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="math-preview__group"><div class="math-preview__dots">{Array.from({length:3},()=> <span class="preview-dot"/>)}</div><strong>3</strong></div>
    <span class="math-preview__symbol">+</span>
    <div class="math-preview__group"><div class="math-preview__dots">{Array.from({length:2},()=> <span class="preview-dot preview-dot--second"/>)}</div><strong>2</strong></div>
  </div>
  <div class="math-preview__whole" aria-hidden="true"><span class="math-preview__symbol">=</span><div class="math-preview__dots">{Array.from({length:5},(_,i)=> <span class:list={["preview-dot",{"preview-dot--second":i>=3}]}/>)}</div><strong>5</strong></div>
  <figcaption id="preview-caption">3 benda dan 2 benda menjadi 5.<br/>Lihat kelompoknya. Temukan hubungannya.</figcaption>
</figure>
